WEBVTT

00:05.780 --> 00:07.130
Lady Ultimatia!

00:07.650 --> 00:08.700
Elder!

00:08.700 --> 00:09.610
Over here!

00:10.220 --> 00:13.580
I can't go over there!
So please, come here quick!

00:13.580 --> 00:16.410
Borgius? How? That's unthinkable.

00:18.010 --> 00:18.740
Tsk.

01:56.800 --> 02:01.230
RAGNA CRIMSON

02:04.600 --> 02:06.980
CHAPTER 23: THE LIGHTNING GOD

02:07.420 --> 02:10.440
For Chimera,
Mister Snake is a good friend.

02:11.290 --> 02:14.410
Mister Snake always helps Chimera.

02:15.210 --> 02:17.450
Even when the crappy armor belittled me...

02:18.970 --> 02:19.870
Question.

02:20.330 --> 02:23.330
Why did the Winged Monarch
suddenly come into view?

02:24.730 --> 02:27.090
Why did the Winged Monarch appear?

02:27.870 --> 02:30.380
Or like when Chimera was separated
from Lord Crimson.

02:32.030 --> 02:35.710
Proposal. You should go back
to Lese immediately.

02:35.710 --> 02:38.050
Follow after the dragon groups.

02:38.050 --> 02:40.560
The Lord will be
where the blood flows.

02:48.370 --> 02:50.600
This is Lord Crimson's scent.

02:51.530 --> 02:54.420
Even though Mister Snake
is Chimera's tail,

02:54.880 --> 02:58.410
why does it know
Lord Crimson more than Chimera?

02:59.280 --> 03:03.370
Perhaps the tail is not actually
Mister Snake, but...

03:10.950 --> 03:12.250
Swap place with me.

03:26.870 --> 03:27.850
How come?

03:30.000 --> 03:31.520
You're supposed to die already.

03:32.160 --> 03:34.530
Why are you still alive...

03:35.030 --> 03:40.200
...Felbegoth?!

03:44.290 --> 03:45.590
Darkness Magic,

03:51.490 --> 03:52.630
World Collapse.

04:13.400 --> 04:14.530
Collapse?!

04:28.410 --> 04:29.330
Snake!

04:29.620 --> 04:33.460
Sorry, but I just have to use it.

04:34.500 --> 04:37.470
You shit!

05:04.200 --> 05:07.250
I finally know the identity of...

05:07.500 --> 05:09.370
...our enemy now!

05:14.420 --> 05:15.750
Kamui!

05:15.750 --> 05:17.300
Protect the progenitor!

05:17.630 --> 05:20.380
You're the only one left now!

06:22.750 --> 06:23.950
Be it speed...

06:24.660 --> 06:26.370
...or technique,
I am better than him!

06:27.120 --> 06:29.870
But he can brute force
with power alone.

06:29.870 --> 06:32.460
I already ran out of gas over here.

06:34.920 --> 06:37.130
Are you inexhaustible?

06:41.300 --> 06:42.630
Hunting...

06:42.630 --> 06:44.510
I guess I'll die.

06:45.640 --> 06:46.550
...Flash!

06:47.620 --> 06:49.470
Nothing I can do.

06:50.170 --> 06:52.730
Become a unique genius.

06:56.020 --> 06:57.900
That took so long.

06:58.360 --> 07:01.530
I finally get it.

07:18.880 --> 07:22.590
Nooo!

07:30.050 --> 07:31.680
No! No!

07:34.430 --> 07:36.020
Lightning God Battle Arts.

07:53.140 --> 07:54.810
Kamui...

07:59.630 --> 08:06.220
I could smell from 100 kilometers away
that she'd come to cut me down.

08:07.050 --> 08:08.740
Of course I wouldn't wait.

08:09.390 --> 08:10.890
I arrived in seconds.

08:23.150 --> 08:24.530
Yet I was cut down.

08:25.070 --> 08:27.220
I can tell without asking, but...

08:27.220 --> 08:28.740
What's happening?

08:29.410 --> 08:31.560
My sword should've been fast.

08:32.530 --> 08:34.830
I also pulled the preemptive.

08:35.409 --> 08:38.289
I was cut down by a slower sword
that moved later than mine.

08:41.289 --> 08:42.539
Eight times!

08:45.380 --> 08:48.880
I'll ask you anyway.
Who are you?

08:53.680 --> 08:55.470
I am death itself.

08:56.470 --> 08:57.680
Correction.

08:57.680 --> 08:59.130
GILZEA, THE MASSACRE DRAGON
I am the Clawed Monarch.

08:59.130 --> 09:00.440
GILZEA, THE MASSACRE DRAGON

09:00.940 --> 09:03.150
So you're visiting your disciple's grave?

09:03.150 --> 09:04.860
I had expected you to come.

09:06.730 --> 09:09.280
You are the Invulnerable Boy, right?

09:09.820 --> 09:12.110
I am the Lady of Massacre.

09:12.660 --> 09:17.770
Before me, you can't trick me
by saying you've healed.

09:18.750 --> 09:22.040
And I am not here
to visit anyone's grave.

09:22.040 --> 09:27.090
I came to test the sharpness of
the one who killed my disciple.

09:27.590 --> 09:29.760
I'm satisfied, so I'll leave.

09:30.050 --> 09:32.260
You can use the Claw as you like.

09:37.530 --> 09:39.640
So you can even alter
the course of the slash?

09:40.560 --> 09:42.900
Oh, you're smart.

09:43.350 --> 09:48.190
It's inevitable for those
who come to cut me to be cut.

09:48.190 --> 09:51.400
It's not a matter of the slashing course.

09:51.400 --> 09:53.690
Heh! What the hell?!

09:54.200 --> 09:56.910
Aren't you the one cheating here?

09:57.620 --> 09:59.330
I'm not cheating.

09:59.330 --> 10:02.870
Just as the sun rises from the east
and sets in the west,

10:03.580 --> 10:06.340
I am the "certainty."

10:06.340 --> 10:07.460
Do you understand?

10:08.380 --> 10:11.170
The possibilities in this world
are already set in stone.

10:11.800 --> 10:15.180
I apologize for making light
of your invulnerability.

10:15.180 --> 10:16.180
Sorry.

10:16.970 --> 10:19.750
You're a genius boy with determination.

10:20.350 --> 10:24.390
As a teacher-type lady,
let me tell you one thing.

10:25.800 --> 10:28.860
If you want to kill me, be unique.

10:29.440 --> 10:31.910
You're gifted with too much talent.

10:32.440 --> 10:35.910
Because you can do anything,
you're now facing a dead end.

10:36.410 --> 10:40.080
Become a unique genius
by fighting and learning

10:40.080 --> 10:43.580
from someone with a completely
different strength than you.

10:43.580 --> 10:48.040
Heh! Where the heck does that kind
of convenient opponent exist?

10:48.040 --> 10:50.960
Isn't it faster to just keep
challenging you?

10:51.260 --> 10:53.370
You can still laugh, I see.

10:53.370 --> 10:56.220
You have despaired
about this world for a bit.

10:56.840 --> 10:59.760
You have destroyed
the world's strongest army.

11:00.220 --> 11:03.980
You felt like you have seen
how far it is to your goal.

11:04.850 --> 11:07.940
But what do you think of
your distance from me?

11:08.360 --> 11:10.520
It's damn impressive!

11:10.900 --> 11:17.240
You want to kill me but you can't.
And that makes you happy, don't you?

11:20.620 --> 11:24.160
You can still enjoy this world.

11:35.260 --> 11:37.180
Prepare yourself.

12:05.910 --> 12:07.250
Hit me.

12:41.660 --> 12:42.990
Damn you...

12:43.450 --> 12:46.580
It's just a little bit more...

12:57.550 --> 13:01.720
Danger...
The cells... are destroyed.

13:02.430 --> 13:06.100
Maintaining a connection...
Difficult.

13:06.100 --> 13:07.180
Die...

13:07.980 --> 13:09.980
Devouring required.

13:10.830 --> 13:13.480
Detecting the smell of a dragon.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.900
Must go there now.

13:18.780 --> 13:20.170
Devour...

13:33.420 --> 13:35.060
Slime!

13:35.790 --> 13:37.920
Come here! Hurry up!

13:37.920 --> 13:39.530
Bring her along!

13:57.400 --> 14:01.610
A speed beyond lighting
with the demonic sword's strength.

14:02.650 --> 14:04.570
Inexhaustible magic!

14:04.870 --> 14:07.120
Sorry for the wait, Gilzea!

14:07.120 --> 14:12.210
I'll kill you, and I'll kill
the Dragon God after you!

14:13.100 --> 14:14.370
Hunting...

14:16.290 --> 14:17.800
...Flash!

14:22.840 --> 14:25.430
Killing the Dragon God?

14:26.430 --> 14:29.390
Silver Sword...

14:29.390 --> 14:31.140
...Recreate Form!

14:33.350 --> 14:36.150
I won't give you that chance!

14:36.150 --> 14:38.610
Because you're going to die here!

14:52.000 --> 14:57.710
Two years have passed since I was
assigned to the 17th Frontline Base.

14:59.920 --> 15:04.090
All Carulas older than me
have finished their duty.

15:04.090 --> 15:07.640
And then I became
the oldest Carula in the base.

15:09.140 --> 15:13.060
I'll have all of us help heal this man.

15:14.100 --> 15:18.780
The one I'm tending to
is also in critical condition...

15:19.730 --> 15:22.940
The person you're healing
is a Fourth-Class Lamb.

15:23.360 --> 15:25.950
Yet, this person is a Second Class Lamb.

15:27.030 --> 15:28.200
Do you understand?

15:30.240 --> 15:34.010
I act unchangingly as a Carula.

15:36.170 --> 15:40.190
I'm no different than others
and act only as a replacement.

15:51.510 --> 15:54.810
Question. What was that
loud noise just now?

15:54.810 --> 15:57.480
The southeast highest level
has been destroyed.

15:57.480 --> 15:59.860
Does any one of me
know the cause?

16:03.320 --> 16:05.490
Just as I thought.

16:05.490 --> 16:11.330
Intruding a battle between superior dragons
and Dragon Scourges is still reckless.

16:14.150 --> 16:15.080
This boy...

16:15.500 --> 16:20.290
It's the lunatic knight who attacks
dragons and the Church indiscriminately.

16:20.580 --> 16:22.960
Heh! Interesting!

16:22.960 --> 16:26.130
- Living ain't fun if it ain't like this!
- Identification name: the Lightning Beast.

16:26.130 --> 16:26.760
Huh?!

16:27.090 --> 16:29.050
What are you gawking at, twerp?!

16:31.470 --> 16:34.560
I wondered where I fell to,
turned out it was the ant nest.

16:35.020 --> 16:38.480
You must be glad you didn't
get squished, Ant Woman.

16:38.480 --> 16:42.360
Nah, that won't even cross
your silly mind, right?

16:42.360 --> 16:43.820
A-Ant...?

16:43.820 --> 16:45.370
Ain't I right?

16:45.370 --> 16:47.740
No matter how many of you die,
there are spares.

16:47.740 --> 16:49.820
All of you are the same
with no identity.

16:50.280 --> 16:54.740
Even among those of the Church,
I hate you girls the most.

16:54.740 --> 16:57.040
I get goosebumps just
by looking at your face.

16:57.420 --> 16:59.230
I don't want to see you.

16:59.710 --> 17:01.420
Now scram!

17:11.930 --> 17:12.640
Excuse me...

17:13.300 --> 17:16.010
My self over there is still breathing.

17:16.010 --> 17:17.680
Would you allow me to heal her?

17:17.680 --> 17:18.599
Hell no!

17:19.099 --> 17:21.020
I told you to scram.

17:21.020 --> 17:25.319
Why should I take my words back
for the sake of small bugs like you?

17:26.530 --> 17:29.170
I-I will also heal your injuries.

17:30.240 --> 17:33.250
So please, in return please let me...

17:41.870 --> 17:44.370
You know, my mother died...

17:45.000 --> 17:48.300
...from electrocution
when she gave birth to me.

17:48.790 --> 17:50.760
My surroundings reject me.

17:51.170 --> 17:55.390
Saying that I should've not been born
because I'm a monster.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.770
But I was born anyway.

17:58.560 --> 18:02.020
Stop shitting me, you shit!

18:02.270 --> 18:10.070
Don't you dare push me
to have a debt I can't ever pay!

18:10.070 --> 18:13.530
Why? Why is he so angry?
I don't understand.

18:13.530 --> 18:15.660
That's why, I've made up my mind.

18:15.660 --> 18:19.330
I won't ever be indebted
to anyone in my life.

18:19.330 --> 18:23.290
If I can't survive with my own power
without depending on anyone,

18:23.790 --> 18:25.750
then I'd rather die!

18:26.040 --> 18:28.420
Do you get it? Get it already!

18:29.130 --> 18:30.210
Last warning!

18:30.710 --> 18:32.170
Go away from my sight!

18:47.150 --> 18:48.820
Scary! He's so scary!

18:48.820 --> 18:51.740
I don't want to die!
I don't want to...

18:57.660 --> 18:58.780
Why...

18:59.500 --> 19:02.540
Why did I think I didn't want to die?

19:03.910 --> 19:05.710
I wonder why.

19:05.710 --> 19:09.130
There won't be anyone
mourning me if I die.

19:10.000 --> 19:14.590
As the fear went away,
I felt it slowly came after me.

19:14.590 --> 19:16.840
No matter how many of you die,
there are spares.

19:16.840 --> 19:18.760
All of you are the same
with no identity.

19:19.300 --> 19:21.450
You don't have to tell me,
I know that already.

19:22.220 --> 19:25.140
All of us are made that way.

19:25.140 --> 19:28.480
You must be glad you didn't
get squished, Ant Woman.

19:28.480 --> 19:32.400
Nah, that won't even cross
your silly mind, right?

19:33.190 --> 19:34.900
Ant, he said?

19:34.900 --> 19:37.700
Sure, I also think that we're alike.

19:38.530 --> 19:39.240
But...!

19:40.810 --> 19:43.290
Now that I think of it,
this is the first for me

19:43.830 --> 19:46.010
to be totally rejected
by someone else.

19:46.870 --> 19:50.090
Although there are spares,
I am still a saint.

19:50.090 --> 19:51.710
I was revered.

19:52.960 --> 19:55.920
For the first time in my life,
I felt anger.

19:55.920 --> 19:56.680
And then...

19:57.590 --> 20:01.510
That anger became one with what
had been building up since my birth.

20:14.900 --> 20:17.150
Why do you return?

20:17.740 --> 20:19.110
Because I'm fed up.

20:19.660 --> 20:20.570
What?

20:21.030 --> 20:24.220
"Save that person.
Don't save that person."

20:24.220 --> 20:25.790
It's always like that.

20:26.200 --> 20:29.250
Who is the one deciding
if something has value or not?

20:29.460 --> 20:30.750
Damned if I know!

20:30.750 --> 20:32.960
Your God, right? Stop!

20:32.960 --> 20:34.670
I won't stop.

20:34.670 --> 20:36.470
You said I'm an ant, didn't you?

20:36.470 --> 20:39.510
But why do you decide
that an ant has no will...

20:43.310 --> 20:45.310
Then go die, you idiot!

20:46.350 --> 20:47.310
Dear Time.

20:49.100 --> 20:50.270
...of its own?

20:50.270 --> 20:51.230
What?!

20:51.520 --> 20:53.820
Even if I die, there is
a replacement for me.

20:54.070 --> 20:56.150
If that won't change,

20:56.150 --> 20:59.780
then at least I want to choose
who I'm going to save.

21:01.110 --> 21:04.270
If you don't want to get healed,
then you'd better move away!

21:05.540 --> 21:06.120
Dear Time!

21:16.630 --> 21:17.590
Wha...

21:28.850 --> 21:29.940
That day...

21:30.350 --> 21:31.190
One day...

21:31.730 --> 21:36.650
The vow that you one-sidedly said,
would become my light.

21:38.400 --> 21:41.360
Even if it doesn't come true...

21:43.490 --> 21:44.650
I...

21:52.540 --> 21:56.340
Kamui!

21:57.960 --> 22:00.220
Stay there!

22:04.970 --> 22:06.110
Come.

22:06.580 --> 22:08.970
I'll show you a Dragon Monarch
killing technique.
